    {
      "category": "overview",
      "field": "program_description",
      "value": "Courses in this program offer a combination of theoretical concepts and project-based learning. You’ll develop foundational knowledge, as well as build practical skills in design thinking and principles, conceptualization, spatial awareness, architectural drawing and representation, digital tools, model making and more.",
      "confidence": 1.0,
