    {
      "category": "career",
      "field": "potential_career_paths",
      "value": "With a background in architecture that spans disciplines, you’ll graduate prepared for a variety of career trajectories. You can seek roles as an architectural intern, interior or industrial designer, graphic designer and more. If you want to become a licensed architect, this program will equip you to pursue graduate studies in the field.",
